  m_Name: S03_Equip_Hard_Hat
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Valari.Data.TutorialData
  <Title>k__BackingField: Equip Your Hard Hat
  <Description>k__BackingField: The hard hat is on the top hook of the PPE station.
    Reach out with your controller and grip it to pick it up, then bring it to head
    height and release it to place it on. You will see a confirmation indicator when
    it is correctly equipped. A hard hat must be worn at all times on the warehouse
    floor, not carried, not left on a shelf, not worn backwards. In a real facility,
    being found without a hard hat in a designated PPE zone is a disciplinary offence
    and in many jurisdictions a legal violation.
  <VoiceOver>k__BackingField: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 60fc1519c61946e4982d8aab857e0b3c, type: 3}
  <HasChallenges>k__BackingField: 1
  <IsInOrder>k__BackingField: 0
